# Trust: Shikaree Z (hidden quest TrustShikareeZ): a level 99 Warrior in Windurst Woods, CoP at Partners Without Fame
# (Three Paths completed, not out of town). Perih Vashai (his failing talks play The Fanged One's 351 (the first) and
# 352; each failing arm talks twice). No permit: the check fails: the failing talk (351 / 352). The Bastok Trust
# Permit only (a GM): the check wants the Windurst one too: the failing talk (351 / 352). The Windurst Trust Permit (a
# GM): 869 (a progress event); finished on option 0 (the finish reads no option): Shikaree Z learned,
# YOU_LEARNED_TRUST. Learned: the failing talk (351 / 352).
lists WindurstWoods/Perih_Vashai/onTrigger WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/869
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=116,-3.7,90.5 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Cop PartnersWithoutFame current
login
trigger Perih_Vashai                    # no permit: the failing talk (351 / 352)
finish-if-event
trigger Perih_Vashai                    # the second talk
finish-if-event
keyitem BastokTrustPermit               # a GM
trigger Perih_Vashai                    # no Windurst permit: the failing talk (351 / 352)
finish-if-event
trigger Perih_Vashai                    # the second talk
finish-if-event
keyitem WindurstTrustPermit             # a GM
trigger Perih_Vashai                    # 869
finish option=0                         # any option: Shikaree Z learned, YOU_LEARNED_TRUST
trigger Perih_Vashai                    # learned: the failing talk (351 / 352)
finish-if-event
trigger Perih_Vashai                    # the second talk
finish-if-event
